## Config

# Do not ignore config/ in Laravel
# config/**
# !config/**example.*
etc/**
!etc/README.md
# Un-ignore directories first so git actually traverses into them - without
# this line, etc/** blocks descent and the *.example exception below never
# gets evaluated for files in subdirectories (confirmed with git check-ignore).
!etc/**/
!etc/**/*.example
.lerd.yaml
auth.json
deploy.*ml
deploy.maml
deploy.php
herd.yml

